// Objective - Lockers 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// ModelDisplayName :
"P2747252307" "Lockers"
// InteractBeginString :
"P998364068" "You search through the lockers."
// InteractCompleteString :
"P1601275428" "You finish searching through the lockers."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - Objective 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P3377684187" "These lockers contain a lot of training and exercise gear, but nothing terribly interesting."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - TaskSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P664575739" "You arrested the vampyr candidates and found some interesting information."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P2478058391" "From the look of these files you found, it seems the Council has been bolstering the ranks of the vampyri for quite some time. In fact, it looks like they're getting ready to field test some kind of new, improved vampyr. If it weren't for you, {HeroName}, we might not have known about these new vampyri until they were upon us! Thanks to you, we may still have a chance to stop them."
// RandomFameString :
"P1549557412" "{HeroName} never falters in the face of danger, even against the Council!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - Lvl6_5thColumn_Mission4 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P3142437808" "According to these files you found in the vampyr training base, it seems the Council is planning to radically alter their vampyr creation process. They plan to start using some kind of induced genetic mutation to turn men into vampyri with little surgical augmentation. If they can do that, they can step up their vampyr production a hundred fold. I have a lead on the facility where they're testing this process. <A HREF={ACCEPT}>If you can find out a little more about the process, we may have a chance to stop their research.</A>"
// AcceptString :
"P1929287962" "Investigate vampyr transformation process"
// SendOffString :
"P1386397164" "If we're lucky, you'll discover that they're a long way from actually using this new vampyr transformation process."
// ActiveTaskString :
"P4005998884" "Investigate vampyr alterations"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P562562391" "I need to know exactly how much progress the Council has made in their efforts to streamline the vampyr creation process."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// MissionDef 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// EntryString :
"P233258494" "From the fresh paint and gleaming metal, it looks like this base was only recently commissioned."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Objective - Refrigerator 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// ModelDisplayName :
"P1869470830" "Gene Samples"
// Description :
"P86810688" "clues to find"
// SingularDescription :
"P883117697" "Find the last clue!"
// InteractBeginString :
"P2760034404" "You search through the samples."
// InteractCompleteString :
"P3228736996" "You finish searching through the samples."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - Objective 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P3150080723" "You found some samples of artificial DNA."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Objective - Files 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - Objective 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P1039707349" "You found some files on the Council's attempts at making new vampyri."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Objective - Desk 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - Objective 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P3288620176" "You found some very interesting records."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Objective - Laptop 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - Objective 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P3055968133" "This laptop contains information on weapons specifications. Interesting, but not what you're looking for."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Objective - Lockers 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - Objective 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P2933067786" "These lockers hold unwashed gym clothes emblazoned with the Council logo."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - TaskSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P3224865219" "You have gained valuable information about the Council's new vampyr program."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P137802888" "You did a great job down there, {HeroName}, and there was a lot of good information to be found. It looks like the Council isn't as far along as we'd feared, but they are definitely making progress on their efforts to improve their vampyr creation process.<br><br>Look at this! It seems that the Council hasn't been working on these new genetic vampyr enhancements on their own. A company called Alderwise Genetics has done a lot of work for them. I'm going to do a bit of research into this company and see what I can find."
// RandomFameString :
"P4029793138" "{HeroName} is synonymous with invincible in my book!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - Lvl6_5thColumn_Mission5 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P3594180945" "I did a bit of digging into Alderwise Genetics, that company mentioned in the Council files. It looks like Alderwise got bought out by a private investor about two years ago, after their CEO died in a car accident. After the buy-out, they fired most of their staff and radically changed the direction of their research. From where I stand, it looks like their private investor may have been the Council. I'll bet anything the Council is using Alderwise as a front company to gain them access to genetic research data they couldn't get their hands on any other way. <A HREF={ACCEPT}>Will you get over to Alderwise Genetics and see if you can find any evidence that the Council is involved with them?</A>"
// AcceptString :
"P3455182570" "Go to Alderwise Genetics and see if you can find evidence that the Council is involved with them"
// SendOffString :
"P473472262" "We still need more information. If Alderwise is close to perfecting the Council's new vampyr transformation process, we need to be forewarned."
// ActiveTaskString :
"P2442801105" "Defeat security chief & his men"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P1931456183" "I need you to get over to Alderwise, pronto. We need more information, {HeroName}!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// MissionDef 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// EntryString :
"P4001036095" "The smell of coffee in the air, the inspirational posters tacked to the walls. No one would ever know that this lab is a Council front company."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - VILLAIN_GROUP 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - PATROLLER1_SEARCHING_DIALOG 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
