// Variable - BOSS_ATTACK_DIALOG 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// BOSS_ATTACK_DIALOG :
"P3976428074" "It seems we underestimated the tenacity of the city's so-called protectors. Unfortunate."

