// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Objective - BodyBag 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// ModelDisplayName :
"P92818099" "Murdered researcher"
// InteractBeginString :
"P497027656" "You open the body bag"
// InteractInterruptedString :
"P826846204" "You have been interrupted"
// InteractCompleteString :
"P271009572" "You have identified the body"
// InteractActionString :
"P1143515829" "Opening..."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - Objective 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P3100228224" "This appears to be the bullet-ridden body of an Alderwise researcher. He won't be able to tell you anything. Not anymore."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - TaskSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P3815903381" "You stopped the Council from eliminating the evidence linking them to Alderwise Genetics."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P1126438809" "A vampyr that breeds true? That's unbelievable! I never guessed the Council's genetic research had gotten this far! If this Progenitor gets away from us, they could hide him in some remote part of the world and ready a vampyr army. I don't know if even the Council realizes the drastic implications of this mad scheme. After all, once the vampyri are no longer converted Council soldiers, who's to say they won't develop their own agenda? We have to stop this, {HeroName}. We have to stop it now."
// RandomFameString :
"P3405486305" "I never feel scared living in Paragon City, because I know that {HeroName} is here."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - Lvl6_5thColumn_Compound6 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P1032280904" "I've talked to everyone I know about the Council, the raid on Alderwise Genetics, and this vampyr Progenitor they've created. I wish I had better news. All I was able to find out is that the genetic research data Alderwise generated was transferred to a single Council base. The trouble is, I don't know which one. <A HREF={ACCEPT}>I need you to hit the streets and interrogate a few Council soldiers.</A> We're working on a clock here, {HeroName}. If we don't find that vampyr Progenitor before the Council spirits him away, we'll never be able to eliminate the vampyri for good."
// AcceptString :
"P431142599" "Hit the streets and interrogate a few Council soldiers"
// SendOffString :
"P1849330621" "The Council won't give up information easily. I hope you're ready to see this through."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - Lvl6_5thColumn_Compound6_Part1 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// ActiveTaskString :
"P4138395571" "Question soldiers about base"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P1487162357" "We need to find out where the Council transferred that research data. And we need to find out quickly."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - VILLAIN_GROUP 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - LOITER_ATTACK_TEXT 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// LOITER_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P1387784861" "I think this is the hero we're looking for!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - TaskComplete 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P2510121517" "One of the soldiers you defeated gave up the name of the base commander."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - Lvl6_5thColumn_Compound6_Part2 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P3581791882" "The name of the base commander is a big break, but we still need to know where his base is located."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - VILLAIN_GROUP 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - LOITER_ATTACK_TEXT 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// LOITER_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P607893659" "{HeroName} is too close to the location of our base!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - TaskComplete 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P4041542292" "On one of the soldiers you defeated, you found a print out detailing patrol routes."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - Lvl6_5thColumn_Compound6_Part3 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P1539342219" "Don't give up now. We're really closing in on the location of Archon Todesco's base."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - VILLAIN_GROUP 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - LOITER_ATTACK_TEXT 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// LOITER_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P886881441" "We must not let {HeroName} find our base!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - TaskComplete 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P2648267487" "On one of the soldiers you defeated, you found a work order."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P1679132847" "You really did it, {HeroName}. Now that we know the location of Todesco's base, we can recover the genetic research data that was taken from Alderwise Genetics. With any luck, that'll get us a lot closer to finding this strange vampyr Progenitor the Council has created."
// RandomFameString :
"P902571351" "I saw {HeroName} fighting the Council. It was so exciting!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - Lvl6_5thColumn_Mission7 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P3576325003" "Now that we know the location of Todesco's base, we should be able to get our hands on that genetic research data the Council took from Alderwise Genetics. I'm also hoping Todesco can tell us more about this vampyr Progenitor the Council has engineered. <A HREF={ACCEPT}>I need you to get over to that base and get the data, {HeroName}.</A> What do you say? You up for it?"
// AcceptString :
"P3639253145" "Go to Archon Todesco's base and get the data"
// SendOffString :
"P3198025799" "I want Todesco behind bars, {HeroName}. He can tell us a lot about the Council's new plans for the vampyri."
// ActiveTaskString :
"P699661611" "Arrest Todesco and his men"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P2443443320" "I need Archon Todesco in a paddy wagon. He's one of the few people who may be able to tell us what's become of this vampyr Progenitor."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// MissionDef 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// EntryString :
"P3979595592" "Not a speck of dirt mars the floor, and the weapons stacked against the wall are clean and gleaming. Archon Todesco runs a tight base."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - VILLAIN_GROUP 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - PATROLLER1_SEARCHING_DIALOG 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// PATROLLER1_SEARCHING_DIALOG :
"P1288661683" "Spread out and maintain a watch. The word is that {HeroName} is on our trail!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - PATROLLER2_SEARCHING_DIALOG 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - PATROLLER_ATTACK_DIALOG1 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// PATROLLER_ATTACK_DIALOG1 :
"P1151247863" "{HeroName} is here!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - PATROLLER_ATTACK_DIALOG2 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// PATROLLER_ATTACK_DIALOG2 :
"P163280803" "Protect Todesco!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - VILLAIN_GROUP 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - BOSS_DISPLAYNAME 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// BOSS_DISPLAYNAME :
"P2106229256" "Archon Todesco"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - BOSS_VILLAIN 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - BOSS_INACTIVE_DIALOG 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// BOSS_INACTIVE_DIALOG :
"P455108068" "So, {HeroName} has come at last. This farce will be over soon."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - BOSS_ATTACK_DIALOG 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// BOSS_ATTACK_DIALOG :
"P3292231386" "Let us see if you are as strong as they say!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Objective - Computer 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Description :
"P237883582" "Find genetic data"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - Objective 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P3985569107" "You found the genetic data on the vampyr Progenitor."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - TaskSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P2111624819" "You have defeated Archon Todesco and secured all the data pertaining to Project Progenitor."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P622999222" "So, this Archon Todesco was actually trying to stop the vampyr Progenitor? I guess he didn't like the idea of a race of true-breeding vampyri running around, with no allegiance to anything but themselves. Come to think of it, I have to say I agree."
// RandomFameString :
"P2068476468" "{HeroName}'s battles with the Council are the talk of the town!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - Lvl6_5thColumn_Mission8 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P1536670947" "According to this Archon Todesco you captured, the Council has the vampyr Progenitor secreted away in the sewers. He'll be heavily guarded, {HeroName}. <A HREF={ACCEPT}>But if you can take him into custody, we may never have to face the nightmare of a true-breeding race of vampyri.</A>"
// AcceptString :
"P56715044" "Take the vampyr Progenitor into custody"
// SendOffString :
"P1091207563" "There's a lot riding on this one, {HeroName}. I know I can count on you to see it through."
// ActiveTaskString :
"P3423160945" "Arrest Progenitor & his guards"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P1358609619" "If you don't find that vampyr Progenitor quickly, the Council will get him out of the country. Once they manage that, there's a chance we'll never find him again!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// MissionDef 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// EntryString :
"P3451933239" "The dark confines of the city sewers press in. The Rise of the Vampyri must end here and now, or all of humanity's future will be in peril."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - VILLAIN_GROUP 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - BOSS_DISPLAYNAME 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// BOSS_DISPLAYNAME :
"P4204882181" "Vampyr Guardian"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - BOSS_VILLAIN 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - BOSS_INACTIVE_DIALOG 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// BOSS_INACTIVE_DIALOG :
"P2325960308" "We shall shed the limitations of humanity forever."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - BOSS_ATTACK_DIALOG 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// BOSS_ATTACK_DIALOG :
"P20967246" "You shall not approach the Progenitor! I will stop you!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - VILLAIN_GROUP 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - BOSS_DISPLAYNAME 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - BOSS_VILLAIN 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - BOSS_INACTIVE_DIALOG 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// BOSS_INACTIVE_DIALOG :
"P3244490391" "This will begin a new age. An age when the Vampyri will rule over a world of quaking cattle!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - BOSS_ATTACK_DIALOG 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// BOSS_ATTACK_DIALOG :
"P3543451673" "The Progenitor is the harbinger of our future! You will not harm him!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - VILLAIN_GROUP 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - BOSS_DISPLAYNAME 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - BOSS_VILLAIN 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - BOSS_INACTIVE_DIALOG 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// BOSS_INACTIVE_DIALOG :
"P4147664057" "The old humanity shall be swept away! Today begins the Rise of the Vampyri!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - BOSS_ATTACK_DIALOG 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// BOSS_ATTACK_DIALOG :
"P1819830754" "What can you possibly do to stop us?"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - VILLAIN_GROUP 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - BOSS_DISPLAYNAME 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// BOSS_DISPLAYNAME :
"P2512742462" "Vampyr Progenitor"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - BOSS_VILLAIN 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - BOSS_INACTIVE_DIALOG 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// BOSS_INACTIVE_DIALOG :
"P1946939375" "We, the Vampyri, shall become the masters of a new world."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - BOSS_ATTACK_DIALOG 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// BOSS_ATTACK_DIALOG :
"P3582512361" "You cannot stop this. This is the next phase of evolution!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - TaskSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P912950930" "With your defeat of the vampyr Progenitor, you have ended the Rise of the Vampyri."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P3908600492" "Well, you've captured the vampyr Progenitor and confiscated all the data on how to make another. All in all, I'd say you've wrapped this up nicely. I'm proud to have worked with you to prevent the rise of an independent species of vampyri, {HeroName}. I'd like to think that one day I'll be able to tell future generations about your valiant perseverance. Come to think of it, those future generations may only exist because of you."
// RandomFameString :
"P1245803252" "I heard the Council is having a lot of trouble finding recruits after {HeroName} trounced them."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
